something that encompasses

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.230
many SIGs, like
architecture, I think is one.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.210
And then project is
something like what we do,

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:56.090
which is contributor
experience, or SIG release,

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.900
which are dedicated to kind of
improving how you get started

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.460
